title: Colleague_Call
---
<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
Ashe: ... I see. 
Unknown: You need to get out of there Ashe. Try to get home befo-
...thud.
Ashe: Hello? Are you still there? 
Ashe: ... Shit. What's going on? 
<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
I need to call Dad. 
===

title: Teddy_Call
---
<<declare $called_teddy = false>>
<<if $called_teddy == false>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Ashe: ...Please pick up. 
	...
	Ashe: Dad! 
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe" "Teddy">>
	Teddy: Ashe! Where are you? I've been trying to call you for hours! 
	Ashe: ... Dad. Please. Tell me the truth. Your leg ... It wasn't an accident was it?
	Teddy: ... 
	Teddy: So you know. ... Please don't do anything reckless Ashe.
	Teddy: The people involved ... they can hurt us. Hurt you. I would never forgive myself if that were to happen.
	Ashe: Dad! This ... 
	Teddy: Pl-
	...click
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Ashe: Dad? My phone lost connection! 
	<<play_sfx SoundManager phone>> 
	Ashe: ... What's that sound? 
	<<set $victor_calling = true>>
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
<<else>>
	It's no use. My phone won't connect.
<<endif>>
===

title: Victor_Call
---
<<declare $victor_calling = false>>
<<declare $victor_called = false>>
<<if $victor_calling == true and $victor_called == false>>
	<<stop_sfx SoundManager>>
	<<start_character_conv CharacterManager "Ashe">>
	Unknown: So you're the "mouse" scurrying around my office. How pleasing to make your acquaintance. 
	Ashe: ...
	Unknown: Unfortunately, I cannot be there in person. But I think we both know the ... circumstances you find yourself in. 
	Ashe: You- ... What do you want? 
	Unknown: ... I want to help you and your father. All I ask for is something simple in return. 
	Ashe: ...
	Unknown: Hand over the evidence you've managed to "acquire". And I will allow you both to relocate to one of my properties.
	Ashe: ... And if I say no? 
	Unknown: Well ... we both know that won't happen. Not with the state your poor father is in. 
	Ashe: Why you-
	...click
	Ashe: ... 
	<<set $victor_called = false>>
	<<end_character_conv CharacterManager>>
	<<jump Ashe_Decision>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Ashe_Decision
---
... What do I do? 
Dad. I-I don't know what to think. 
-> Escape with the evidence
	...
	I won't let that bastard get away with this. 
	<<show_cutscene DialogueManager 4>>
-> Hand over the evidence
	...
	This is for the best. We can be happy. 
	This is ... for dad. It is. 
	<<show_cutscene DialogueManager 5>>
===

title: Ending_1
---
And they all lived happily ever after.
<<end_game GameManager>>
